{"id": "50", "pred": "A water pick offers several benefits for oral health. It helps eliminate germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line. It can clean areas around the teeth and gums that brushing cannot access, effectively removing food particles. Additionally, it massages and stimulates soft tissue in the mouth, which helps reduce the risk of gingivitis. Overall, it contributes to maintaining good oral health and can leave the mouth feeling cleaner.", "raw_output": "Answer: A water pick offers several benefits for oral health. It helps eliminate germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line. It can clean areas around the teeth and gums that brushing cannot access, effectively removing food particles. Additionally, it massages and stimulates soft tissue in the mouth, which helps reduce the risk of gingivitis. Overall, it contributes to maintaining good oral health and can leave the mouth feeling cleaner.", "gt": "A water pick, also known as a Waterpik, is a beneficial tool for oral care. It is designed to shoot a strong stream of water at the gum line to help eliminate germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush. It can also help maintain overall body health. In comparison to flossing, using a water pick can be easier and leave your mouth feeling cleaner. It can also massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. It is especially useful in cleaning around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot reach.", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 17.271, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 54.55, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
