{"id": "119", "pred": "The name Teresa has multiple meanings across different cultures and languages. In Greek, the meaning of Teresa is \"Reap\" or \"Harvester,\" derived from \"therizein,\" meaning \"to harvest.\" It is also associated with the Greek island Therasia. In Italian, the name means \"Harvester,\" while in Spanish, it is linked to the names of two popular saints, Teresa of Avila and Thérèse of Lisieux. In American usage, the meaning is \"Reap\" or \"from Therasia.\" Additionally, the name Teresa is considered the Spanish, Portuguese, and Italian form of Theresa, which in Greek means \"Reaper.\" The name's usage as a female given name dates back to pre-Middle Ages in Spain and Portugal.", "raw_output": "The name Teresa has multiple meanings across different cultures and languages. In Greek, the meaning of Teresa is \"Reap\" or \"Harvester,\" derived from \"therizein,\" meaning \"to harvest.\" It is also associated with the Greek island Therasia. In Italian, the name means \"Harvester,\" while in Spanish, it is linked to the names of two popular saints, Teresa of Avila and Thérèse of Lisieux. In American usage, the meaning is \"Reap\" or \"from Therasia.\" Additionally, the name Teresa is considered the Spanish, Portuguese, and Italian form of Theresa, which in Greek means \"Reaper.\" The name's usage as a female given name dates back to pre-Middle Ages in Spain and Portugal.", "gt": "The name Teresa is of Greek, American, Italian, and Spanish origin. In Greek and American, it means 'Reap; from Therasia.' In Italian, it is interpreted as 'Harvester.' In Spanish, the name is associated with two popular saints, 'Teresa of Avila' and 'Therese of Lisieux.' The name is also thought to originate from the Greek “therizein” meaning “to harvest, harvester” or from the Greek “theros” meaning “summer”.", "question": "teresa name meaning", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 26.51, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 53.21, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
