{"id": "264", "pred": "1. Improving oxygen efficiency in the blood with the same amount of work.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Enhancing nutrient absorption, including vitamins and minerals.\n4. Supporting the full utilization of Co-enzyme Q10, which requires sulfur (MSM) to be effective.\n5. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reducing inflammation caused by injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by helping regulate cellular water pressure and swelling.", "raw_output": "The benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Improving oxygen efficiency in the blood with the same amount of work.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Enhancing nutrient absorption, including vitamins and minerals.\n4. Supporting the full utilization of Co-enzyme Q10, which requires sulfur (MSM) to be effective.\n5. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reducing inflammation caused by injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by helping regulate cellular water pressure and swelling.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of MSM powder:\n\n1. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable and allowing nutrients to be absorbed more efficiently.\n2. Helps reduce inflammation and swelling in muscles and joints.\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n4. Enhances the absorption of vitamins and minerals, including Co-enzyme Q10.\n\nNote that the passages do not mention any other specific benefits of MSM powder beyond these points.", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 18.351, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 44.04, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "265", "pred": "1. Improving oxygen efficiency in the blood with the same amount of work.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Enhancing nutrient absorption, including vitamins and minerals.\n4. Supporting the full utilization of Co-enzyme Q10, which requires sulfur (MSM) to be effective.\n5. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reducing inflammation caused by injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by helping regulate cellular water pressure and swelling.", "raw_output": "The benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Improving oxygen efficiency in the blood with the same amount of work.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Enhancing nutrient absorption, including vitamins and minerals.\n4. Supporting the full utilization of Co-enzyme Q10, which requires sulfur (MSM) to be effective.\n5. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reducing inflammation caused by injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis by helping regulate cellular water pressure and swelling.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n* Helping to increase oxygen efficiency in the blood\n* Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable\n* Enhancing nutrient absorption, particularly when taken with Co-enzyme Q10\n* Relieving muscular aches and pains\n* Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis\n\nTherefore, MSM powder has several benefits for overall health and wellness, including improved oxygenation, energy, and reduction of pain and inflammation.", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 18.227, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 53.21, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "266", "pred": "Visual merchandising is a strategic approach used by retailers to attract and influence consumers by creating appealing in-store environments. As mentioned in the passage, the visual merchandiser aligns store presentation with the retailer’s overall strategy and goals. It plays a crucial role in influencing consumer behavior, particularly through elements like shop windows, which are studied for their impact on buying decisions. According to the passage, visual merchandising not only draws attention but also actively encourages consumer action—comparing it to making a horse drink after marketing has brought it to the water. This highlights its direct relationship with consumer behavior, especially in influencing choices based on factors like gender and store attributes in shopping centers.", "raw_output": "Visual merchandising is a strategic approach used by retailers to attract and influence consumers by creating appealing in-store environments. As mentioned in the passage, the visual merchandiser aligns store presentation with the retailer’s overall strategy and goals. It plays a crucial role in influencing consumer behavior, particularly through elements like shop windows, which are studied for their impact on buying decisions. According to the passage, visual merchandising not only draws attention but also actively encourages consumer action—comparing it to making a horse drink after marketing has brought it to the water. This highlights its direct relationship with consumer behavior, especially in influencing choices based on factors like gender and store attributes in shopping centers.", "gt": "Visual merchandising is a strategy used by retailers to attract customers to their store and influence their buying behavior. It involves the presentation of the store and its merchandise in a way that aligns with the retailer's goals and marketing strategy. The visual merchandiser's role is crucial as they not only help bring customers to the store but also influence their purchasing decisions, akin to \"making the horse drink\" as per G. Surrendar's analogy. Particularly, visual merchandising related to shop windows has been found to significantly impact consumer buying behavior, with variations observed based on gender and the store attributes most valued by consumers in shopping centers.", "question": "introduction to visual merchandising and relation to the consumer", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 22.99, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 55.63, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "271", "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include a missed period, bloating, spotting, cramping, mood swings, dizziness, and nausea or vomiting. Mood swings can occur due to hormonal changes, while dizziness may result from blood vessel dilation and lower blood pressure. Nausea and vomiting, commonly known as morning sickness, affect about half of all pregnant women and typically begin around six weeks after the last menstrual period.", "raw_output": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include a missed period, bloating, spotting, cramping, mood swings, dizziness, and nausea or vomiting. Mood swings can occur due to hormonal changes, while dizziness may result from blood vessel dilation and lower blood pressure. Nausea and vomiting, commonly known as morning sickness, affect about half of all pregnant women and typically begin around six weeks after the last menstrual period.", "gt": "The earliest signs of pregnancy often include mood swings and unusual emotional behavior due to a flood of hormones in the body. Dizziness can also occur as pregnancy causes blood vessels to dilate and blood pressure to drop. Other early symptoms can include a missed period, bloating, spotting, and cramping. Approximately half of all pregnant women experience nausea and vomiting, and around 3 in 10 women experience nausea without vomiting, with these symptoms typically starting around six weeks after their last period.", "question": "earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 15.077, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 59.65, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "272", "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include a missed period, bloating, spotting, cramping, mood swings, dizziness, and nausea or vomiting. Mood swings can occur due to hormonal changes, while dizziness may result from blood vessel dilation and lower blood pressure. Nausea and vomiting, commonly known as morning sickness, affect about half of all pregnant women and typically begin around six weeks after the last menstrual period.", "raw_output": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include a missed period, bloating, spotting, cramping, mood swings, dizziness, and nausea or vomiting. Mood swings can occur due to hormonal changes, while dizziness may result from blood vessel dilation and lower blood pressure. Nausea and vomiting, commonly known as morning sickness, affect about half of all pregnant women and typically begin around six weeks after the last menstrual period.", "gt": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, bloating, spotting, cramping, nausea, and vomiting.", "question": "earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 15.069, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 40.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "276", "pred": "Severe osteoporosis refers to an advanced stage of the condition where there has been significant bone density loss, leading to extremely weak bones that are highly susceptible to fractures. In this stage, the bones may fracture easily, even without trauma or falls. Common sites for fractures include the spine, hips, and wrists. Spinal compression fractures can occur spontaneously, causing sudden, severe back pain that worsens with standing or walking and improves when lying down. Other symptoms of severe osteoporosis include chronic back pain, progressive loss of height, and a stooped posture due to vertebral collapse. Without treatment, individuals with severe osteoporosis are at a high risk of debilitating fractures that can severely impact mobility and quality of life.", "raw_output": "Severe osteoporosis refers to an advanced stage of the condition where there has been significant bone density loss, leading to extremely weak bones that are highly susceptible to fractures. In this stage, the bones may fracture easily, even without trauma or falls. Common sites for fractures include the spine, hips, and wrists. Spinal compression fractures can occur spontaneously, causing sudden, severe back pain that worsens with standing or walking and improves when lying down. Other symptoms of severe osteoporosis include chronic back pain, progressive loss of height, and a stooped posture due to vertebral collapse. Without treatment, individuals with severe osteoporosis are at a high risk of debilitating fractures that can severely impact mobility and quality of life.", "gt": "Severe osteoporosis is a condition characterized by significant bone density loss, resulting in weakened bones and increased risk of fractures. Symptoms may include sudden and severe back pain, loss of height over time, fractures of the vertebrae, wrists, hips, or other bones. Without treatment, fractures, particularly in the spine or hips, are likely to occur.", "question": "what is severe osteoporosis", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 24.925, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 46.77, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
