assage 2 also highlights that compression fractures of the spine are a common cause of osteoporosis pain, which can be severe and debilitating. Therefore, severe osteoporosis is characterized by a high risk of fractures, particularly in the spine and hips, as well as persistent back pain and loss of height.", "question": "what is severe osteoporosis", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 24.591, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 45.57, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
