{"id": "467", "pred": "Hiking offers numerous benefits as a hobby. It promotes mental health by helping combat symptoms of stress and anxiety, as noted by Gregory A. Miller, PhD, president of the American Hiking Society. Being in nature has a positive impact on psychological well-being. Hiking is also a cardiovascular activity that improves heart health, reduces the risk of heart disease, and increases overall fitness. Additionally, exposure to sunshine during hikes helps boost vitamin D levels. Hiking is inexpensive, easy to start, and accessible to people of all fitness levels, making it a convenient hobby. It also allows individuals to explore and become familiar with their local areas.", "raw_output": "Answer: Hiking offers numerous benefits as a hobby. It promotes mental health by helping combat symptoms of stress and anxiety, as noted by Gregory A. Miller, PhD, president of the American Hiking Society. Being in nature has a positive impact on psychological well-being. Hiking is also a cardiovascular activity that improves heart health, reduces the risk of heart disease, and increases overall fitness. Additionally, exposure to sunshine during hikes helps boost vitamin D levels. Hiking is inexpensive, easy to start, and accessible to people of all fitness levels, making it a convenient hobby. It also allows individuals to explore and become familiar with their local areas.", "gt": "Hiking as a hobby has numerous benefits for both the body and the mind. It is an inexpensive and accessible activity that can be enjoyed by individuals of all fitness levels. Hiking allows people to explore and discover beautiful natural areas, promoting a deeper connection with the environment. It also has positive effects on mental health, reducing stress and anxiety. Additionally, hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can improve overall fitness and reduce the risk of heart disease. Exposure to sunshine during hiking can also increase vitamin D levels in the body. Overall, hiking offers a wide range of benefits for individuals seeking physical and mental well-being.", "question": "benefits of hiking as a hobby facts", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 22.113, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 55.94, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
