{"id": "478", "pred": "The U.S. Postal Service (USPS) offers a Change of Address service that allows individuals and businesses to forward their mail to a new address. This service can be completed in as little as 1 minute online and notifies up to 100 organizations in addition to USPS. There are three ways to change your address: (1) Visit https://moversguide.usps.com/ and use identity validation with a $1 charge to your credit or debit card, (2) Call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or (3) Fill out and submit PS Form 3575 either in person at a Post Office, by mail, or through a Postal Mail Carrier. This service is useful for permanent moves, temporary relocations, or after a disaster requiring relocation.", "raw_output": "Answer: The U.S. Postal Service (USPS) offers a Change of Address service that allows individuals and businesses to forward their mail to a new address. This service can be completed in as little as 1 minute online and notifies up to 100 organizations in addition to USPS. There are three ways to change your address: (1) Visit https://moversguide.usps.com/ and use identity validation with a $1 charge to your credit or debit card, (2) Call the USPS Call Center at 1-800-ASK-USPS (1-800-275-8777), or (3) Fill out and submit PS Form 3575 either in person at a Post Office, by mail, or through a Postal Mail Carrier. This service is useful for permanent moves, temporary relocations, or after a disaster requiring relocation.", "gt": "Passage 3 provides information on how to change your address with the U.S. Postal Service. You can visit their website, call the USPS Call Center, or fill out and submit a form at a U.S. Post Office.", "question": "change of address u.s. postal service", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 30.694, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 37.74, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
