{"id": "488", "pred": "These steps will help you prepare thoroughly for a successful and enjoyable trip to Germany.", "raw_output": "To plan a trip to Germany, consider the following steps based on the provided passage:\n\n1. **Research visa requirements**: Ensure you understand the visa regulations for entering Germany.\n2. **Choose the right time and destination**: Decide when and where to go in Germany based on your interests and the best travel seasons.\n3. **Explore what to see**: Identify attractions and places of interest in German cities and regions.\n4. **Plan transportation**: Learn how to get around Germany, including options like public transportation and car rentals.\n5. **Budget wisely**: Use budget travel tips to save money on flights, accommodations (such as hostels or cheap hotels), food, and sightseeing.\n6. **Travel with pets (if applicable)**: If bringing pets, research pet-friendly accommodations, air travel rules, vaccinations, and pet policies on German trains.\n7. **Learn about German culture**: Understanding German life and culture can enhance your travel experience.\n\nThese steps will help you prepare thoroughly for a successful and enjoyable trip to Germany.", "gt": "To plan a trip to Germany, it is important to plan ahead and be aware of the rules and regulations regarding travel with pets. It is also recommended to research the best ways to save money during your trip, such as looking into discounted flights, cheap hotels and hostels, and affordable dining options. Additionally, learning about German life and culture can enhance your overall trip experience.", "question": "how to plan a trip to germany", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 33.792, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.55, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "489", "pred": "You can tell who liked your tweet by using websites such as Favotter.net and Favstar.fm, which track who has favorited your tweets. Additionally, you can set up your Twitter account to receive email notifications whenever someone marks one of your tweets as a favorite by going to your Twitter Settings, clicking on the Notifications link, and enabling the appropriate options.", "raw_output": "You can tell who liked your tweet by using websites such as Favotter.net and Favstar.fm, which track who has favorited your tweets. Additionally, you can set up your Twitter account to receive email notifications whenever someone marks one of your tweets as a favorite by going to your Twitter Settings, clicking on the Notifications link, and enabling the appropriate options.", "gt": "You can see who liked your tweets by using tracking websites such as Favotter.net and Favstar.fm. These sites can give you an idea of who is favouriting your tweets. Alternatively, you can also set up notifications on Twitter itself. By going to your account settings and clicking on the notifications link, you can arrange to be notified via email whenever someone likes one of your tweets.", "question": "how can you tell who liked your tweet", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 13.372, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 65.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
