emaining 50% going to a charitable cause.\n\nTherefore, raffles typically involve buying tickets with unique numbers, and a random draw determines the winner, with a percentage of the proceeds often going to a charitable cause.", "question": "how do raffles work", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 26.904, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 47.8, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
