{"id": "542", "pred": "These traits are derived from astrology, numerology, and cartomancy, as noted in the passage.", "raw_output": "Based on the provided passages, people born in October exhibit a variety of traits depending on their specific birth date:\n\n- Those born on **October 1** are described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful. They prefer being in control, working independently, and have good people skills, though they can occasionally show impatience.\n- Those born on **October 5** are restless at heart but crave stability and security, which drives them to work hard in their endeavors.\n- Those born on **October 14** have a strong interest in form and structure, making them well-suited for careers in architecture, interior design, or other fields that blend art and structure.\n\nThese traits are derived from astrology, numerology, and cartomancy, as noted in the passage.", "gt": "People born in October are described as having a keen interest in and an eye for form and structure, which can make them good architects, interior decorators, designers, or any profession that combines art and structure. They are also described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful individuals. They are at their best when they are in control, their own boss, or working on their own. They can also get along with others and possess necessary \"people skills\", although they can occasionally show impatience. Despite being restless at heart, they crave stability and security, which is why they work hard at whatever they do.", "question": "what traits do people have that are born in october?", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 26.565, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
