{"id": "573", "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. Mice can rapidly take up residence in your home and start nesting, so prompt steps are essential. Seal off entry points such as pipes or vents, and consider placing steel wool inside them before sealing. This acts as an additional barrier to prevent mice from re-entering. Additionally, eliminate any sources of food or shelter, as rodents are attracted to these. By addressing entry points and removing attractants, you can effectively remove mice and prevent their return.", "raw_output": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. Mice can rapidly take up residence in your home and start nesting, so prompt steps are essential. Seal off entry points such as pipes or vents, and consider placing steel wool inside them before sealing. This acts as an additional barrier to prevent mice from re-entering. Additionally, eliminate any sources of food or shelter, as rodents are attracted to these. By addressing entry points and removing attractants, you can effectively remove mice and prevent their return.", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can start by identifying all possible entry points that mice use to get into your house. Once identified, consider putting steel wool inside these holes or vents before sealing them off. This will prevent the mice from using these paths to re-enter your home. By doing so, you eliminate their access to food or shelter in your house, which can help in getting rid of them quickly.", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 18.268, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 54.84, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
