continuous and interconnected, while the endocrine system consists of discrete organs.\n* The nervous system uses neurons to transmit signals, while the endocrine system uses the circulatory system.\n\nSimilarities:\n\n* Both systems are devoted to maintaining homeostasis by coordinating and regulating the activities of other cells, tissues, organs, and systems.\n* Both systems are regulated by negative feedback mechanisms.\n* Chemical messengers are important in both systems, although their method of transmission and release differs.\n\nTherefore, based on the given passages, the nervous system and endocrine system have different structures and methods of transmission, but they share similar functions and regulatory mechanisms.", "question": "similarity and difference between nervous system and endocrine system", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 36.196, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 36.64, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "637", "pred": "These benefits make jalapeños a healthy addition to the diet.", "raw_output": "Jalapeño peppers offer several health benefits, primarily due to their capsaicin content, which is responsible for their heat. These benefits include:\n\n1. Pain relief – Jalapeños have pain-killing properties.\n2. Weight loss – They can serve as a spicy alternative to support weight loss.\n3. Decongestant – Jalapeños act as a natural nasal decongestant.\n4. Heart health – They may help prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and strokes, improving cardiovascular health.\n5. Antioxidant and nutrient-rich – Jalapeños are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants.\n\nThese benefits make jalapeños a healthy addition to the diet.", "gt": "Jalapenos have numerous health benefits due to their capsaicin content. They have pain-killing properties and can serve as a natural nasal decongestant. They may also aid in weight loss and prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and possibly even cancer. Additionally, jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. They can also help increase cardiovascular health and defend heart health.", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 23.568, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 3.7, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
