{"id": "712", "pred": "The exercises that tone the chest include a modified tri-set for the chest, pushups paired with heavy dumbbell bench presses, and a dumbbell curling exercise where you lie on your back, extend your arms out to the sides, and curl the dumbbells together above your chest.", "raw_output": "Based on the passage, the exercises that tone the chest include:\n\n1. A modified tri-set for the chest, which is designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue to allow for muscle growth.\n2. Pairing pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses, referred to as the \"second chest blast.\"\n\nAdditionally, the passage describes a specific dumbbell exercise:\n- Lying on your back with dumbbells in each hand, extending arms out to the sides to form a cross, then slowly curling the hands together until the dumbbells meet above the center of the chest, and slowly returning to the starting position.\n\nThese exercises are part of The Anarchy Workout program, which focuses on high-intensity interval training to build lean muscle and tone the chest.\n\nAnswer: The exercises that tone the chest include a modified tri-set for the chest, pushups paired with heavy dumbbell bench presses, and a dumbbell curling exercise where you lie on your back, extend your arms out to the sides, and curl the dumbbells together above your chest.", "gt": "Passage 2: The exercises that tone the chest include modified tri-set for the chest, pushups, and dumbbell bench presses.", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 36.064, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 48.89, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
