{"id": "724", "pred": "Overall, the weather in Welles", "raw_output": "The weather in Wellesley varies throughout the week:\n\n- On Tuesday, August 23, the forecast is 82 degrees and sunny, with a 39% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the North-Northwest.\n- On Wednesday, August 24, the forecast is 79 degrees and sunny, with a 28% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the North-Northeast.\n- On Thursday, August 18, the forecast is 83 degrees and sunny, with a 42% chance of rain and 8 mph winds from the West-Southwest.\n- On Friday, August 19, the forecast is 83 degrees and sunny, with a 42% chance of rain and 5 mph winds from the Northwest.\n- On Sunday, August 21, the forecast is 81 degrees and sunny, with a 36% chance of rain and 10 mph winds from the South.\n- On Monday, August 22, the forecast is 77 degrees with moderate or heavy rain and thunder, with a 52% chance of rain and 8 mph winds from the South.\n\nOverall, the weather in Welles", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "question": "weather in wellesley", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "vcd", "has_vcd": false, "time_sec": 41.771, "status": "success", "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
